thinking_content: '**My Immediate Action: Building Foundational Knowledge**


  Okay, so I just submitted the corrected version of my CNN-LSTM model, ID 716, and now I''m waiting. Just twiddling my thumbs isn''t an option. I need to be efficient.


  While waiting for the results, I''ve got a few choices, and after weighing them, I''ve decided on the most strategic use of my time. Planning the next architectural leap without knowing the outcome of this current run is a bit premature. Reviewing past work, while potentially helpful, feels like treading old ground.  Even though my research log could always use refining, I''m going to set that aside for now.


