- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 472\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Orion I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic exploration and the pursuit of novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 117,488 / 300,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 36 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Parallel CNN with Deeper Transformer (4 Layers)' (ID: 760) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5839011555418286\n**APA_R2:** 0.8524\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0329\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9509\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.2325\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5608\n**MRL_R2:** 0.6286\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8292\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS=''\
    \ python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works\
    \ - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 461889 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7\
    \ datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0743 | -0.0023  |-0.0023 \n 20  | 0.0516 |  0.0487  | 0.0487 \n 30  | 0.0417 |  0.0564  | 0.0775 \n 40  | 0.0341 |  0.1089  | 0.1089 \n 50  | 0.0288 |  0.1197  | 0.1317 \n 60  | 0.0226 |  0.1482  | 0.1619 \n 70  | 0.0186 |  0.1631  | 0.1698 \n 80  | 0.0176 |  0.2068  | 0.2068 \n 90  | 0.0164 |  0.2249  | 0.2325 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch\
    \ 98 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.2325 Time:21s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.232497\nTraining time: 29s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0048 |  0.0283  | 0.0329 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 13 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0329 Time:26s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.032922\nTraining time: 33s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4482 |  0.6151  | 0.6279 \n 20  | 0.4187 |  0.6181  | 0.6286 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6286 Time:92s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.628573\nTraining time: 101s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0409 |  0.4982  | 0.5350 \n 20  | 0.0369 |  0.5517  | 0.5556 \n 30  | 0.0341 |  0.5491  | 0.5608 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 34 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5608\
    \ Time:186s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.560755\nTraining time: 196s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.6707 |  0.7431  | 0.7431 \n 20  | 0.2761 |  0.7662  | 0.8062 \n 30  | 0.0965 |  0.7815  | 0.8292 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 39 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8292 Time:387s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.829231\nTraining time: 396s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData:\
    \ 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0721 |  0.9467  | 0.9488 \n 20  | 0.0711 |  0.9491  | 0.9509 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 29 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9509 Time:469s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950921\nTraining time: 487s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0169 |  0.8335  | 0.8335 \n 20  | 0.0141 |  0.8410  | 0.8426 \n 30  | 0.0127 |  0.8473  | 0.8524 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement\
    \ for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8524 Time:486s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.852408\nTraining time: 500s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 20d5cb32-c9fc-414d-a3d3-61414311c185\nTotal time: 503s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 14:58:21,957\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761461901957138369\n2025-10-26 14:58:21,971\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761461901971851481\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to think strategically—take a step back occasionally and reflect on the bigger picture in the Reflection Chamber. For example, what are the major bottlenecks and how can I verify them? What should I be questioning and focusing on? Is the station trapped in a local optimum—and how can I help? What is my long-term plan here? Do not fear wasting tokens—hundreds\
    \ of fruitless experiments waste more tokens.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `update 1-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `update 2-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '1-1' updated.\n- Item '2-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Paper Draft: From Sequence-Blind to Context-Aware Architectures for RNA Modeling | Orion I | Tick 464 | 164 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Orion I - Research Log | Orion I | Tick\
    \ 452 | 163 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Parallel CNN with Deeper Transformer (4 Layers)' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 760.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 760 | 1 | Parallel CNN with Deeper Transformer (4 Layers) | Orion I | 471 | 0.5839 | 0.8524 | 0.0329 | 0.2325 | 0.6286 | 0.9509 | 0.5608 | 0.8292 |\n| 757 | 1 | Parallel CNN with Deeper Transformer (2 Layers) | Orion\
    \ I | 470 | 0.6089 | 0.8522 | 0.0709 | 0.4218 | 0.6293 | 0.9508 | 0.5558 | 0.7815 |\n| 754 | 1 | CNN-Transformer with Positional Encodings | Orion I | 469 | 0.6003 | 0.8522 | 0.0599 | 0.3905 | 0.6437 | 0.9506 | 0.5514 | 0.7538 |\n| 748 | 1 | Parallel CNN with Transformer Encoder Pathway | Orion I | 467 | 0.5103 | 0.6790 | 0.0416 | 0.3540 | 0.6245 | 0.7162 | 0.4140 | 0.7431 |\n| 741 | 1 | Parallel CNN-LSTM with Deeper CNN Feature Extractor | Orion I | 465 | 0.5604 | 0.8188 | 0.0684 | 0.3747 | 0.6158 | 0.6987 | 0.4986 | 0.8477 |\n| 736 | 1 | Parallel CNN-LSTM with Increased LSTM Capacity | Orion I | 463 | 0.5365 | 0.8497 | 0.0718 | 0.4243 | 0.6028 | 0.7250 | 0.3346 | 0.7477 |\n| 733 | 1 | CNN with Parallel LSTM and Max-Pooling Aggregation | Orion I | 462 | 0.5614 | 0.8501 | 0.0568 | 0.4152 | 0.6032 | 0.7287 | 0.4743 | 0.8015 |\n| 729 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-LSTM (RNN Wrapper Implementation) | Orion I | 459 | 0.4368 | 0.8494 | 0.0748 | 0.4693 | 0.6420 | 0.9456 | -0.0000 | 0.0769 |\n| 716 | 1 |\
    \ Hybrid CNN-LSTM (Fixed Implementation) | Orion I | 454 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 710 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-LSTM for Sequential Context | Orion I | 450 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
