    \ |  0.5799  | 0.6025 \n 20  | 0.4507 |  0.5904  | 0.6125 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 29 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6125 Time:35s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.612525\nTraining time: 40s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0575 |  0.3405  | 0.3429 \n 20  | 0.0561 |  0.3488  | 0.3551 \n 30  | 0.0558 |  0.3500  | 0.3596 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.3596 Time:37s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.359619\nTraining time: 43s\n\nStarting\
    \ RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0375 |  0.6487  | 0.6516 \n 20  | 0.0371 |  0.6476  | 0.6533 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 26 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6533 Time:50s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.653312\nTraining time: 61s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1188 | \
    \ 0.6862  | 0.6897 \n 20  | 0.1185 |  0.6863  | 0.6917 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 27 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6917 Time:111s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.691670\nTraining time: 123s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 0ed00d0a-4282-443f-8461-bcde61730563\nTotal time: 126s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 07:12:06,328\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761433926328971028\n2025-10-26 07:12:06,343\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761433926343333730\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);\n2. `review 701` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the\
    \ Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 701 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 760 | 1 | Parallel CNN with Deeper Transformer (4 Layers) | Orion I | 471 | 0.5839 | 0.8524 | 0.0329 | 0.2325 | 0.6286 | 0.9509 | 0.5608 | 0.8292 |\n| 757 | 1 | Parallel CNN with Deeper Transformer (2 Layers) | Orion I | 470 | 0.6089 | 0.8522 | 0.0709 | 0.4218 | 0.6293 | 0.9508 | 0.5558 | 0.7815 |\n| 754 | 1 | CNN-Transformer with Positional Encodings | Orion I | 469 | 0.6003 | 0.8522 | 0.0599 | 0.3905 | 0.6437\
